coil experiment, a dynmic scan with a setup of which the second dynamic is a \
noise measurement.\\nThe input file is the Nii file that conatins the \
individually reconstruted coil images and the noise data.\\nInternally it \
uses CoilSNRCalc and SumOfSquares. \\n\\nOutput is the coil data with coil \
noise data and snrmap based on the SumOfSquares addition, the SOS \
reconstruction and the SOS weights.\\n{dataC, noiseC, sosC, snrC, sigmapC, \
