PCA only withing the mask.\\nPCADeNoise[data, mask, sig] removes rician noise \
from the data with PCA only withing the mask using sig as prior knowledge or \
fixed value.\\n\\nOutput is de {data denoise, sigma map} by default if \
PCAOutput is Full then fitted {data dnoise , {sigma fit, average sigma}, \
{number components, number of fitted voxesl, number of max fits}, total fit \
-time per 500 ittt}.\\n\\nPCADeNoise[] is based on DOI: \
10.1016/j.neuroimage.2016.08.016 and 10.1002/mrm.26059.\"\>", 
