t1 the time between the 90 degree RF pulse and the first 180 degree RF pulse, \
\\nt2 the time betwteen a 180 degree RF pulse and the following readout (and \
2xt1 the time between two consecutive 180 degree RF pulses.\\nFurther defines \
necho the number of 180 degree RF pulses, din the spin system given the \
hamiltonian ham using b1.\\nThe t1 and t2 are defined in ms, and b1 of 100% \
