          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"CoilCombine[sig] combines the coil signals sig. \
Where sig is {nCoils, ...}.  \\nCoilCombine[sig, cov] combines the coil \
signals sig. Where sig is {nCoils, ...} and cov the complex noise correlation \
matrix.\\nCoilCombine[sig, cov, sens] combines the coil signals sig. Where \
sig is {nCoils, ...} and cov the complex noise correlation matrix and sense \
the coils sensitivity.\\n\\nPossible coil combination methods are \
\\\"Sum\\\", \\\"RootSumSqaures\\\", \\\"RoemerEqualNoise\\\", \
\\\"RoemerEqualSignal\\\", \\\"WSVD\\\".\\nRootSumSquares needs the signal. \
Can be performed with and without the noise covaricance \
matrix\\nRoemerEqualNoise needs the signal and the noise covaricance matrix. \
Can be performed with and without the sense data, without sense data the \
sensitivity is estimated using the singal and the RSS reconstrucntion of the \
signa.\\nRoemerEqualSignal needs the signal and the noise covaricance matrix \
and the sense data.\\nWSVD needs the signal and the noise covariance \
matrix.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
