   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "TriExponentialT2Fit[data, EchoTimes] fits the t2 based on Azzabou N \
et.al. Validation of a generic approach to muscle water t2 determination at \
3T in fat-infiltrated skeletal muscle. J. Magn. Reson. 2015.\nThe fat t2 \
parameters are automatically estimated from the high signal voxels from the \
last echo.\n\nThe output is in units as defined by the EchoTimes, e.g. if \
EchoTimes is in ms the output is in ms.\nThe output fraction is between 0 an \
1.\n\nOutput is {{S(0), fatFraction, muscleFraction, T2map},callibration} or \
{S(0), fatFraction, muscleFranction, T2map}.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|
