    "PatchesToData[patches, ranges] reconstructs data from patches at the \
given ranges.\nPatchesToData[patches, ranges, dim] reconstructs into an array \
of dimensions dim. Overlapping patches are averaged.\nPatchesToData[patches, \
ranges, dim, labels] reconstructs segmentation patches. For each label only \
the largest connected component is kept and overlapping labels are resolved. \
Returns a merged integer segmentation.", 
