         {
          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"SurfaceDistance[ref, pred] gives the surface \
distance of segmentations ref and pred for class 1, assuming isotropic unit \
voxels. Use the vox argument for correct physical \
distances.\\nSurfaceDistance[ref, pred, class] gives the surface distance for \
the given integer class.\\nSurfaceDistance[ref, pred, {class, ..}] gives the \
