broadening with linewidth gam and a Voigt line shape to the fid. The time can \
be obtained using GetTimeRange.\\nTimeShiftFidV[fid, time, {gamL, gamG}] \
aplies a line broadening with linewidth gamG \\\"Gaussian\\\" and gamL \
\\\"Lorentzian\\\".\\nTimeShiftFidV[fid, time, gyro, {gam, eps}] aplies a \
line broadening with linewidth gam to the fid and a phase eps that results in \
eps ppm shift of the spectra. The gyro can be obtained with \
GetGyro.\\nTimeShiftFidV[fid, time, gyro, {{gamL, gamG}, eps}] aplies a line \
broadening with linewidth linewidth gamG \\\"Gaussian\\\" and gamL \
\\\"Lorentzian\\\" to the fid and a phase eps that results in eps ppm shift \
of the spectra.\\n\\nThe linewidth gam is given in ms and the spectra shift \
eps is given in ppm.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
