rule of the fitted parameters {d0->val, tau-> tau, zeta \
->zeta}.\\nFitRPBMFunction[tms, dat, init] does the same but uses init as \
inital guess values.\\nFitRPBMFunction[tms, dat, init, fix] does the same but \
uses init as inital guess values and fixes the parameters in fix.\"\>", 
